{"ref":"BDB, כֶּ֫לֶא","hw":"כֶּ֫לֶא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּ֫לֶא</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>confinement, restraint, imprisonment</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.27\">1 K 22:27</a> + 6 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּלְאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.29\">2 K 25:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.33\">Je 52:33</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">Is 42:22</a>;—<em>confinement</em>, in combin. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית (ה)כ׳</span> (cf. Assyrian <em>bît kīli</em>, <em>prison</em>, Dl <sup>HWB 328</sup>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.27\">1 K 22:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.26\">2 Ch 18:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.4\">2 K 17:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.15\">Je 37:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.7\">Is 42:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽתֵּי כְלָאִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">22</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בַּ֫יִת\" href=\"/BDB,_בַּ֫יִת\", dir=\"rtl\">בַּיִת</a> <strong>1</strong> (ε) (2) p. 109 supr.; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, כלוא\" href=\"/BDB,_כלוא\", dir=\"rtl\">כלוא</a> infr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנְדֵי כִלְאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.29\">2 K 25:29</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.33\">Je 52:33</a> <em>garments of imprisonment</em> = prison-garb.","next":"BDB, כלוא","prev":"BDB, כָּלָא"}